TITLE:: PV_HPshiftDown
summary:: Shifts spectral content downward
categories:: UGens>FFT
related:: Classes/FFT, Classes/IFFT, Classes/PV_ChainUGen

DESCRIPTION::
Processes an FFT chain and shifts its spectral content downward. This UGen must be placed between FFT and IFFT.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new

ARGUMENT:: chain
A PV chain produced by FFT or another PV UGen.

ARGUMENT:: shift
The amount of downward spectral shift expected by the plugin.

RETURNS::
A PV chain.

EXAMPLES::

code::
(
{
    var source = WhiteNoise.ar(0.05);
    var chain = FFT(LocalBuf(2048), source);
    chain = PV_HPshiftDown(chain, 4);
    IFFT(chain) ! 2
}.play;
)
::
